Scope of this license

This license covers only files written for agent-ee or produced by its runs
from such files: the files that docs/file-origins.json lists with origins AE
or AE-RUN and no other origin. It grants no rights in any file with another
origin. Those files come from, or are derived from, other projects or parties,
including FOME-MC, FOME-Tech, rusEFI, KiCad, mck1117/wideband, semiconductor
vendors, distributors and the public boards named in benchmarks/seeded/. They
include src/agent_ee/checks.py, which adapts FOME-MC code, and the evidence
archives. These files are not offered under this license. docs/file-origins.json
lists each one with its origin, known upstream license and publication status,
and docs/third-party-origins.md summarizes them.
